003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNEVER INSTALLED\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ciframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/oU2cYazAoCE\" title=\"YouTube video player\"\u003e\u003c\/iframe\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFinally, a bolt on solution for your E28\/E34! \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese are for E28\/E34 cars with non vented rear rotors (will not fit M or 540 cars) \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese are made from 6061-T6 aluminum, and are compatible with Wilwood calipers. They bolt on with no hub removal. E brake removal is necessary but you can easily add an inline manual valve to use the secondary calipers as your e brake if needed (see installation video for info).\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe only modification required is some backing plate trimming, or removal completely. You can reference our e30 install video as it will be similar (link at bottom)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eComes with all necessary 12.9 grade hardware.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor use with either 120-9689 or 120-9690 Wilwood dynapro calipers. Also recommend Polymatrix A compound pads, but pad compound choice might vary based on driving style.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAvailable in Black\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTorque all hardware to 45 ft\/lbs and use supplied thread locker\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt is very important that the mounting face is clean, as well as the area above the bracket (where the wheel bearing is pressed in) there is only a few mil of room between the bracket and the hub, excess rust, or thick powder coating will cause the bracket not to sit correctly, this will be evident if the bolts are difficult to thread in due to misalignment. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eStandard BP20\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e - (\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e150-20-6812K)\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAggressive+ BP-40 - (150-12242K)\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-08-01T11:39:41-04:00","created_at":"2025-08-01T11:37:27-04:00","updated_at":"2026-10-21T14:43:30-04:00","vendor":"GARAGE SALE","product_type":"Dual Caliper Bracket","tags":["brakes","brakes_calipers_brackets","e28","e28sbvc","e34","e34sbvc","suspension","suspension_drift_related"],"variants":[{"id":46823577714875,"title":"No \/ No","option1":"No","option2":"No","option3":null,"sku":"WLS-GS-DHQ-LGR-DCB","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"100.00","grams":4536,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":8140341182651,"created_at":"2025-08-01T11:37:28-04:00","updated_at":"2026-10-21T14:43:30-04:00"}],"images":[{"id":34129242095803,"created_at":"2023-01-29T20:30:16-05:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2023-01-29T20:30:16-05:00","product_id":8140341182651,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0629\/9556\/2683\/products\/image_a7a04a37-5458-45f1-94e5-565c60db38c5.jpg?v=1675042216","width":1024,"height":576},{"id":34129242128571,"created_at":"2023-01-29T20:30:16-05:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2023-01-29T20:30:16-05:00","product_id":8140341182651,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0629\/9556\/2683\/products\/image_872fd405-18e0-4205-9c02-26e69344dde0.jpg?v=1675042216","width":1024,"height":576},{"id":34129242161339,"created_at":"2023-01-29T20:30:16-05:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2023-01-29T20:30:16-05:00","product_id":8140341182651,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0629\/9556\/2683\/products\/image_3f8d4437-db81-451c-9b54-c71d6ae37933.jpg?v=1675042216","width":960,"height":720},{"id":34129242194107,"created_at":"2023-01-29T20:30:16-05:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2023-01-29T20:30:16-05:00","product_id":8140341182651,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0629\/9556\/2683\/products\/image_0c09feb1-296e-4aa8-be47-d6b7c7a5476b.jpg?v=1675042216","width":1024,"height":576},{"id":34129242226875,"created_at":"2023-01-29T20:30:16-05:00","position":5,"updated_at":"2023-01-29T20:30:16-05:00","product_id":8140341182651,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0629\/9556\/2683\/products\/image_312d9022-3435-4308-be0a-b35a691d6236.jpg?v=1675042216","width":720,"height":960},{"id":34129242259643,"created_at":"2023-01-29T20:30:16-05:00","position":6,"updated_at":"2023-01-29T20:30:16-05:00","product_id":8140341182651,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0629\/9556\/2683\/products\/image_5708b143-b2bc-4090-a41c-db3e7eeef838.jpg?v=1675042216","width":960,"height":720}],"options":[{"name":"Add Calipers","position":1,"values":["No"]},{"name":"Add Brake Pads","position":2,"values":["No"]}]},{"id":8147068420283,"title":"[GARAGE SALE] - SWAGIER - BMW E30 E21 E34 Z3 E36 COMPACT Toe angle adjustment","handle":"garage-sale-swagier-bmw-e30-e21-e34-z3-e36-compact-toe-angle-adjustment","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-decoration: underline;\"\u003e******THIS IS NOT A NEW CONDITION PRODUCT - NO ACCEPTABLE REFUNDS - READ BELOW******\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOPEN BOX\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNEVER INSTALLED\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThis kit has been specially designed to eliminate the problem of the camber setting becoming out of adjustment even under the greatest overloads and angles.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThis product is primarily used to change rear wheel camber. It allows you to adjust your suspension to your needs. This is useful in various motorsports disciplines such as DRIFT or ¼ MILE racing – primarily to achieve maximum traction on the drive axle – as well as in stance projects. Changing the rear wheel angle allows you to \"stuff\" larger rims without having to modify the wheel arches.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe kit is dedicated to the rear suspension of the BMW e30, e36 compact, Z3 E21 E34 E32\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eScrews: hardness 10.9, galvanized\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBeans: made of S355 steel, milled on CNC machines.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe product is made in POLAND!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2025-08-06T09:12:30-04:00","created_at":"2025-08-06T09:11:26-04:00","updated_at":"2026-10-21T14:43:30-04:00","vendor":"GARAGE SALE","product_type":"Eccentric Lockout Kit","tags":["e36","e36sbvc","steering","steering_tie_rods_spacers_alignment","SUSPENSION","swagier-updated"],"variants":[{"id":46837343125691,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"WLS-GS-DHQ-SWAGIER-0024","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"70.00","grams":454,"compare_at_price":"99.14","position":1,"product_id":8147068420283,"created_at":"2025-08-06T09:11:26-04:00","updated_at":"2026-10-21T14:43:30-04:00"}],"images":[{"id":34129299144891,"created_at":"2023-01-29T20:53:16-05:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2023-01-29T20:53:16-05:00","product_id":8147068420283,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0629\/9556\/2683\/products\/1_3d468932-8183-414c-851d-d39